    "sam.msf.shockdef": "MSF: circulatory impairment or shock, assessed as in MSF Clinical guidelines chapter 1 (Shock).",
    "sam.msf.diag": "Skin pinch and sunken eyes are often present in SAM without dehydration. MSF classifies dehydration in SAM with 2 or more of: mental status, thirst, urine output, recent frequent watery diarrhoea/vomiting, and recent rapid weight loss.",
    "sam.msf.target": "Target weight {tw} kg ({basis}).",
    "sam.msf.c.mon": "Measure blood glucose and treat hypoglycaemia; monitor vital signs and signs of dehydration every 15–30 min; monitor urine output.",
