    "sam.msf.c.3": "Oral/NG not tolerated (e.g. vomiting): stop ReSoMal; G5%-RL IV {r10} mL/h (10 mL/kg/h) for 2 h. To prepare G5%-RL: remove 50 mL from a 500 mL Ringer's lactate bag and add 50 mL of 50% glucose.",
