    "sam.acf.stop": "Stop all rehydration if: target weight reached; visible veins become full; oedema appears; neck veins become prominent or engorge when the liver is pressed; liver grows by > 1 cm or becomes tender; breathing rate rises by ≥ 5/min; grunting; crackles; or a triple (gallop) rhythm.",

